{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WALLS is a First person horror game featuring bizzare visuals, VHS camera, and bunch of eyes hanging on the wall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 4 types of ghosts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 1<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00025.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blue - Don't get too close. otherwise they will chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00026.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yellow - Fastest ghost. there's no detect range. but, be careful. you can collide with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00030.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red - Biggest ghost. if you see them, get away as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00028.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invisible - No movement. but, be careful. it's hard to see</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00014.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key - Try to find all the keys.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687020?t=1746097771","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687020?t=1746097771","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/5c0c5d56f46f3362e86b887c72dccea579421d2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746097771","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/5c0c5d56f46f3362e86b887c72dccea579421d2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746097771","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WALLS is a First person horror game featuring bizzare visuals, VHS camera, and bunch of eyes hanging on the wall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are 4 types of ghosts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 1<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00025.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blue - Don't get too close. otherwise they will chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00026.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yellow - Fastest ghost. there's no detect range. but, be careful. you can collide with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DAY 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00030.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red - Biggest ghost. if you see them, get away as far as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00028.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invisible - No movement. but, be careful. it's hard to see</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/extras/ScreenShot00014.png?t=1746097771\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key - Try to find all the keys.</p>","developers":["Jihoooni"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687020/755a31035276eb46857cd48d69853262895970f5/header.jpg?t=1746097771","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133363,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133363/movie480.mp4?t=1746017094","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133363/movie_max.mp4?t=1746017094"},"name":"WALLS - Official Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133363/12b3e6aec2ef13126991bebedbf405d4df2c77da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746017094","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133363/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746017094","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133363/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746017094"}}],"name":"WALLS","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3-3225 3.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4